A file whose path does not end in any `artifact:` of the named playbook is no artifact of it: the
move is refused before anything is written or any hook runs.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-hooks
title: Hooks
summary: Hook-bearing fixture for transition.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  only: []

states:
  main:
    artifact: index.md
    initial: intaking
    statuses:
      intaking:
        transitions:
          - to: noted
            when: the environment is recorded
            hooks: ["script env-note"]
      noted: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/only/prompt.md --
---
summary: Only step.
---

Only body.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/_scripts/env-note --
#!/bin/sh
{
  echo "artifact=$BOOPING_ARTIFACT"
  echo "workdir=$BOOPING_WORKDIR"
  echo "cwd=$(pwd)"
} > "$BOOPING_WORKDIR/env.txt"
